Z||000003||Cooter||11-12-2001||07:43 PM||||I changed my back lit gauges to red (easier on the eyes) just by painting the plastic panel the gauges mount in with flourescent (sp?) red spray paint and used red bulbs. It is a little dim, but overall it works good.||||reg||1
