Z||000005||LZeitgeist||11-12-2001||10:24 PM||||There is a layer of red transparency inside the layers of clear plastic making up the gauges - changing the color of reflector and/or bulbs will not remove the red coloring completely in the V-6 gauge package.<P>------------------<BR>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>- 1st Place - Stock Coupe - FOCOSEVA 2000<BR>- 3rd Place - Stock Formula - FOCOA Nat'l 2001<BR>- Class Winner - 1982 to Present - 2001 Tarheel Tigers All-Pontiac Show||||reg||1
